    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Medical College, Aga Khan University is celebrating a proud milestone as Dr Duriya Rehmani, Senior Instructor in the Department of Obstetrics and Gynaecology, has been awarded the prestigious MRCOG Gold Medal by the Royal College of Obstetricians and Gynaecologists (RCOG). The award recognizes her top performance in the MRCOG Part 3 exam, making her the first Pakistani to receive this honour. She will officially be presented with the medal at the RCOG awards ceremony in 2026.",
